<td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thanks for your time on the phone.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">For a limited time only, save up to 15% off the base fare (excluding taxes, fees and surcharges) on eligible international flights* to&nbsp;<b>New Zealand, Asia, North and South America, Africa</b>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<b>London</b>.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">To take advantage of this offer, book via your Qantas Business Rewards account, or through your preferred travel agent between 4 and 12 February 2019, for immediate travel to 30 June 2019*.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Refer to the table below for the eligible Qantas Business Rewards discounts off the base fares on flights for bookings and travel during the offer period above. Subject to availability and not available on all flights or days.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellspacing="0" class="discountTD"><tbody><tr style="border-bottom: none !important;"><td align="center" rowspan="2" width="102" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; padding: 20px 10px; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); width: 102px !important;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Business Rewards Membership Level</font></td><td align="center" colspan="2" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; padding: 20px 10px; border-top: 1px solid rgb(245, 245, 245); border-right: 1px solid rgb(255, 255, 255); border-left: 1px solid rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(228, 0, 0); border-bottom: none !important;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Business</font></td><td align="center" colspan="2" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; padding: 20px 10px; border-top: 1px solid rgb(245, 245, 245); border-right: 1px solid rgb(255, 255, 255); border-left: 1px solid rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(228, 0, 0); border-bottom: none !important;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Premium Economy</font></td><td align="center" colspan="2" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); line-height: 20px; text-align: center; padding: 20px 10px; border-top: 1px solid rgb(245, 245, 245); border-right: 1px solid rgb(255, 255, 255); border-left: 1px solid rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(228, 0, 0); border-bottom: none !important;"><font