&nbsp;<a class="underline three" href="https://www.qantas.com/agencyconnect/au/en/products-and-network/qantas-business-rewards/qantas-business-rewards-offers.html" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;">Qantas Business Rewards</a>&nbsp;or with your preferred travel agent.</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="font-size: 10px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 15px; margin: 0px;"></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 23px; margin: 0px; height: 23px;"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); line-height: 22px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Important information</font></h3></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" bgcolor="#F4F5F6" width="600" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 15px; height: 15px; margin: 0px; width: 600px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 680px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody><tr><td align="center" valign="top" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" style="margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">A business must be a Qantas Business Rewards Member to earn Qantas Points for the business. Membership of Qantas Business Rewards and the earning of Qantas Points as a business are subject to the&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Qantas Business Rewards Terms and Conditions</a>.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">* Subject to availability, not available on all flights or days. Offer ends 11:59pm 12 February 2019 unless sold out prior. Qantas Business Rewards Members must (a) book an eligible flight between 12.01AM (AEDT) 4 February 2019 and 11.59pm (AEDT) 12 February 2019 for travel between 4 February 2019 and 30 June 2019, (b) quote registered Qantas Business Rewards ABN and Flyer's Qantas Frequent Flyer membership number at the time of booking (c) book travel via Qantas Business Rewards, an IATA or TIDs registered travel agency or ticketed via an approved Ticketing Consolidator. An eligible flight means a domestic or international flight which has a Qantas 'QF' flight number on the ticket that is purchased in Australia; is operated by Qantas or American Airlines; has a ticket number commencing with '081'; and is booked and travelled for business on or after the date the business registers for Qantas Business Rewards.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#definationAirline" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">Exclusions apply</a>. Discounts available exclusively to Qantas Business Rewards Members on eligible Economy Saver, Economy Flex, Premium Economy Sale, Premium Economy Saver, Premium Economy Flex, Business Sale, Business Saver and Business Flex fares only to selected destinations in North America, South America, New Zealand, Asia, Africa and London and do not apply to taxes, fees and carrier charges. Availability is limited. Other conditions apply. Travel agents or customers on a Corporate Deal with Qantas are not eligible for this offer.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantasbusinessrewards.com/terms#definationAirline" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(123, 123, 123); border: 0px;">See full terms and conditions</a>. Not to be used in conjunction with any other offer.</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr><td class="t_c" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 10px; color: rgb(123, 123, 123); line-height: 13px; height: 13px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;<br></font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
</tr>
